§ `Article 52(4): designation by the Commission, and delegated acts to amend Annex XIII`

-- First subparagraph: "The Commission may designate a general-purpose AI model as presenting systemic risks, ex officio or following a qualified alert from the scientific panel pursuant to
-- Article 90(1), point (a), on the basis of criteria set out in Annex XIII." An unconditional power: it is limited by its own wording to a general-purpose AI model and to the Annex XIII basis.
-- src:779 | 4. The Commission may designate a general-purpose AI model as presenting systemic risks, ex officio or following a qualified alert from the scientific panel pursuant to Article 90(1), point (a), on the basis of criteria set out in Annex XIII.
@ref Art 52(4) first subparagraph (src:779)
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE
      `the model is a general-purpose AI model` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the designation is made on the basis of the criteria set out in Annex XIII` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Art 52(4) the Commission may designate the model as presenting systemic risks` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF NOT (`Art 51 the group applies on the date asked` `the date asked`)
            THEN NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): Chapter V applies from the date Art 113 gives
        IF NOT `the model is a general-purpose AI model`
            THEN NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "The Commission may designate a general-purpose AI model"
        IF `the designation is made on the basis of the criteria set out in Annex XIII`
            THEN JUST TRUE
        OTHERWISE NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the power is given "on the basis of criteria set out in Annex XIII" (the grant ruling: a power limited by its own wording)

-- src:780 | The Commission is empowered to adopt delegated acts in accordance with Article 97 in order to amend Annex XIII by specifying and updating the criteria set out in that Annex.
